WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.728
An interpretation should point to text evidence; personal connections support but do

00:00:04.728 --> 00:00:06.237
not replace the text.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:13.331
“Ama sorted paper and plastic into separate bins.” What is the main idea? Answer: Ama

00:00:13.331 --> 00:00:14.989
separated waste for recycling.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:19.899
Explain a character's choice using one sentence from a story as evidence.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.537
Discuss why: The central action is sorting waste.
